~ start

if Global.offered_dumplings == true
	if Global.minigame_success == true
		Sheep: Thank you for the food!
	else:
		Sheep: It wasn't what I was looking for...
	set Global.offered_dumplings = false
	=> END

Sheep: Hello, you are?
Sheep: Ah, the new merchant. You sell dumplings to the Jade Emperor don't you?
Sheep: Dumpling making is a delicate process that requires great patience. You must have learned a lot from your family. Though, you seem downward. What's wrong?

~ main_menu
- Is the Jade Emperor a fan of my family's dumplings?
	Sheep: Is that the reason? I'm sure the Jade Emperor favors your dumplings more than any other.
	=> main_menu
- I'm just questioning some things.
	Sheep: I can offer an ear if you want to talk about your troubles.
	=> sub_menu
- Offer dumplings
	Sheep: Oh thank you! I will have {{GameManager.get_ingredients()}} dumplings please.
	set Global.offered_dumplings = true
	do Global.start_dumplings_minigame()
	=> END
- Walk away
	if [Global.offered_dumplings == false]
		Sheep: Oh, see you another time.
	=> END
	
~ sub_menu
- I suppose I’m questioning my destiny. My only hobbies are making dumplings and seasoning the meat for the dumplings... 
	=> SheepAdvice
- ...Will this truly be my life for the next 500 years?
	=> SheepAdvice
- Back
	=> main_menu
	
~ SheepAdvice
Sheep: Oh! I'm so sorry :'(
Sheep: I have never been the best at making decisions and often rely on others. 
	During the Great Zodiac Race, I had only made it due to Rooster and Monkey’s help in making a raft that carried us over. 
	Perhaps finding a companion to accompany you throughout the next 500 years will help. 
	I’m truly sorry I could not offer much advice as destiny is a tricky thing that even us Zodiac animals do not fully understand. 
	I’m sure the other animals can offer their own perspective. Have you talked to Rooster yet?

=> main_menu

=> END